In reality, the Colors are just three young girls who spend their time playing make-believe and exploring the city. The Colors’ activities are facilitated by the grandfatherly Daigorou \"Pops\" Kujiraoka, who uses his store’s inventory of knick-knacks to entertain the rambunctious trio.\n\nNot everyone is a fan of the Colors though. The local policeman Saitou just wants to deal with his regular duties, but he often finds himself the target of the Colors’ attention, having been made the villain in most of their fantasies. But despite his personal feelings, Saitou always finds the time to go along with the three girls’ games. Even though the Colors do not actually defend Ueno, they definitely help brighten everyone’s day.","poster_path":"/uiB412p9JIfTqavtfJ54Izd64TD.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,35],"popularity":10.5255,"first_air_date":"2018-01-07","softcore":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":28,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/1qxFtePUVvX0dMMzBEMGhB2Oc7u.jpg","id":36089,"name":"The Legend of the Legendary Heroes","original_name":"伝説の勇者の伝説","overview":"At his emperor's command, Ryner Lute and his long-time comrade Ferris set out on a search for the Heroic Relics. During this journey, Ryner makes a shocking discovery - a deadly curse is spreading across the continent.","poster_path":"/lEwhuJ0mQGFJI4oGGewXfMMnmNy.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"popularity":10.7821,"first_air_date":"2010-06-26","softcore":false,"vote_average":8,"vote_count":61,"origin_country":["JP"]}],"total_pages":17,"total_results":324},"similar":{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/7MvcGimIdLrreRgVPhoQLq8FHjp.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10762],"id":565,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Muppet Babies","overview":"","popularity":16.5158,"poster_path":"/oJc14qy42hABKKWlQwEguFdeTdU.jpg","first_air_date":"1984-11-05","softcore":false,"name":"Muppet Babies","